  m_Name: F7- Letter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Octobass.Waves.Item.LoreItemDefinition
  Name: F7 - Letter
  Text: "Dear Diary,\r\nFathers temper is getting worse and worse. I dread to think
    what he would do if he found out about Hronn and B\xE1ra snuck out the other
    day. Mara was only in the wrong place at the wrong time yesterday and he struck
    her and sent her to be banished for a day in the caves. \r\n\r\nI hate it here."
